8. Current Work:
The work was in the planning/reading phase for Wave 2 + file splitting. The last actions were reading the HTML file to understand the current state of data constants (lines 206–533). The TodoWrite with 10 tasks was created and task 1 (lib/data.js) was set to in_progress. No actual code has been written for Wave 2 or the file splitting yet.

